{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNOfflineStorage(py)packs","title":"packs","roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"packs","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"packs","kind":"identifier"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"strong","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"readonly","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSArray<MLNOfflinePack *>","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSArray"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"packs","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/ManageOfflineRegionsExample"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This property is set to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":", indicating that the receiver does not yet know"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the existing packs, for an undefined amount of time starting from the moment"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the shared offline storage object is initialized until the packs are fetched"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the database. After that point, this property is always non-nil, but it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"may be empty to indicate that no packs are present."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To detect when the shared offline storage object has finished loading its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"packs"},{"type":"text","text":